WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.800
San Matthew Kapitulo 4

00:02.800 --> 00:09.240
Tisperto in turungna ni Jesus ijelet ang tatnusulisogan ti Diablo,

00:09.700 --> 00:15.400
kalpasan tiupat apulong aldaw kinrabi asaan na apanangan na bisinan ni Jesus.

00:16.100 --> 00:18.560
Imasidig kinkwana ti Diablo kit kinunana.

00:19.340 --> 00:22.300
Nusika ti anak ti Diyos,

00:22.700 --> 00:26.640
pagbalingem at tinapay dagitoy abato.

00:26.640 --> 00:30.000
Nga'ng insungbat ni Jesus,

00:30.800 --> 00:32.420
kuna tinasantuan na surat,

00:33.400 --> 00:35.860
saan lang at tinapay tipagbyag ti tao,

00:36.700 --> 00:40.340
nudi paiket titunggal balikas ng agkapo iti Diyos.

00:41.120 --> 00:44.580
Ti Diablo in turungna ni Jesus itinasantuan na syudad

00:44.580 --> 00:48.000
kit impan na itikangatuan na paset ti templo.

00:48.600 --> 00:49.400
Sana kinuna.

00:50.200 --> 00:53.360
Nusika ti anak ti Diyos,

00:53.980 --> 00:55.440
tumapuak ka man,

00:56.300 --> 00:56.580
agsigna,

00:56.640 --> 00:59.820
siputakuna tinasantuan na surat,

01:00.560 --> 01:06.100
bilinen to ti Diyos dagit iang heles na amang aywan kenka,

01:06.980 --> 01:11.500
tapayain na kanto tap nuuray dagit isakam,

01:12.120 --> 01:15.200
saan amadunor itibato.

01:16.620 --> 01:18.640
Nga'ng insungbat ni Jesus,

01:19.640 --> 01:21.480
kunamet tinasantuan na surat,

01:22.800 --> 01:25.400
di mo sulisugan ti apo a Diyos mo.

01:25.400 --> 01:25.480
Nga'ng insungbat ni Jesus,

01:25.480 --> 01:25.500
kunamet tinasantuan na surat,

01:25.500 --> 01:25.520
di mo sulisugan ti apo a Diyos mo.

01:25.520 --> 01:29.380
Impan ti Diyablo itinakangat nga to abantay

01:29.380 --> 01:35.640
kit impakita na kinkwana dagiti amin apagarian ditoy lubong agraman dayagda.

01:36.360 --> 01:40.520
Itdektukin ka amin dagito'y.

01:41.400 --> 01:42.580
Kinuna ti Diyablo,

01:43.400 --> 01:47.380
nuwag pa rin tuming kinagdayaw ka kanya.

01:48.640 --> 01:50.040
Insungbat ni Jesus,

01:50.840 --> 01:52.660
Pumanaw ka, satanas,

01:52.660 --> 01:55.200
kuna tinasantuan na surat,

01:55.520 --> 01:58.380
agdaydayaw ka iti apo a Diyos mo,

01:59.160 --> 02:00.520
ket isulaeng tipagsirbiyan.

02:01.960 --> 02:02.680
Itikasta,

02:03.160 --> 02:04.320
Pumanaw ti Diyablo.

02:04.980 --> 02:06.400
Dimteng dakit ang hiles

02:06.400 --> 02:08.080
ket nagsirbida kin ni Jesus.

02:08.860 --> 02:10.240
Idi nadamag ni Jesus

02:10.240 --> 02:11.460
anay balod ni Juan

02:11.460 --> 02:13.520
nagsubli iji Galilya,

02:14.200 --> 02:16.100
saan anagtayang iji Nasaret,

02:16.660 --> 02:18.920
napankit din nagnayad iji Kapernaum,

02:19.500 --> 02:21.040
may sangaili itiigit

02:21.040 --> 02:22.520
tidanaw tidi Galilya,

02:23.100 --> 02:24.560
itisakop dagit idagat

02:24.560 --> 02:25.220
iji Zabulon,

02:25.520 --> 02:26.520
ken Neftali.

02:27.160 --> 02:28.200
Na aramid daytoy

02:28.200 --> 02:29.180
tatnumatong pal

02:29.180 --> 02:31.760
timpaddo ni Profeta Izayas.

02:32.360 --> 02:33.780
Dagati Zabulon,

02:34.060 --> 02:35.240
ken dagati Neftali.

02:35.960 --> 02:38.660
Itisibay tidanaw iti Balasio iti Hordan.

02:39.340 --> 02:41.400
Galilya pagnaedan dagiti Hentil.

02:42.080 --> 02:43.900
Dagiti tattaong agnaed

02:43.900 --> 02:45.020
iti kasipngitan,

02:45.360 --> 02:47.440
nakita dati naranyag alawag.

02:48.000 --> 02:49.360
Ket kadagiti agnaed

02:49.360 --> 02:51.380
iti nasipngit adaggan ipatay

02:51.380 --> 02:53.020
nagranyag tilawag.

02:53.780 --> 02:55.160
Manipod iti dayta at siyempo,

02:55.520 --> 02:56.960
rinugyan ni Jesus

02:56.960 --> 02:57.820
tinangasaba.

02:58.340 --> 02:59.560
Agbabawi kayo

02:59.560 --> 03:00.820
kadagiti Basbasolio,

03:01.580 --> 03:03.120
agsipod taasidagan

03:03.120 --> 03:04.520
tipagaryan tilangit.

03:06.400 --> 03:07.920
Idi magmagnan ni Jesus

03:07.920 --> 03:09.160
itiigit tidanaw

03:09.160 --> 03:09.980
ti Galilya,

03:10.660 --> 03:11.600
nakita na dagiti

03:11.600 --> 03:13.160
agkabsat amang ngalap

03:13.160 --> 03:14.300
ni Simon,

03:14.880 --> 03:15.940
amanagan Pedro,

03:16.540 --> 03:17.360
kin ni Andres.

03:18.020 --> 03:19.180
Iwaywayat da idi

03:19.180 --> 03:21.160
itiikit da iji danaw.

03:22.000 --> 03:22.780
Surutan dak,

03:22.780 --> 03:24.620
kat pagbalinan kayo

03:24.620 --> 03:25.500
ito amang ngalap,

03:25.520 --> 03:26.420
kadagiti tao.

03:27.180 --> 03:28.960
Kinunan ni Jesus kadakwada.

03:29.840 --> 03:31.160
Pinanawanda a dagos

03:31.160 --> 03:32.060
dagiti ikit da,

03:32.220 --> 03:33.660
kit si Muro da kinkwana.

03:34.440 --> 03:36.360
Intuloy ni Jesus tinagnakit

03:36.360 --> 03:38.600
nakita natin sa balipay ng agkabsat,

03:39.340 --> 03:40.760
da Santiago kin Juan

03:40.760 --> 03:42.380
na anak ni Sibidio.

03:43.140 --> 03:44.580
Silulugan da iti bangka

03:44.580 --> 03:46.000
agraman ni Sibidio,

03:46.580 --> 03:48.760
kit isagsaganada dagiti ikit da.

03:49.400 --> 03:50.600
Inayaban ni Jesus ida.

03:51.580 --> 03:52.860
Dagos a pinanawanda

03:52.860 --> 03:53.500
iti amada,

03:53.500 --> 03:55.500
kin tibangka kit si Muro,

03:55.520 --> 03:56.840
da kin ni Jesus.

03:58.840 --> 04:00.100
Sinurusor ni Jesus

04:00.100 --> 04:01.200
ti amin apaset

04:01.200 --> 04:01.960
ti Galilea.

04:02.580 --> 04:03.860
Nangisursuro ti unag

04:03.860 --> 04:05.040
dagiti sinaguga da,

04:05.580 --> 04:06.540
inkas kasabana

04:06.540 --> 04:07.720
tinaymbaga da mag

04:07.720 --> 04:09.080
maipapan iti pagaryan,

04:09.600 --> 04:10.860
nangagagas ka dagiti

04:10.860 --> 04:11.680
naduma-duma

04:11.680 --> 04:12.420
asaksakit

04:12.420 --> 04:13.920
kin sagsagaban

04:13.920 --> 04:14.840
dagiti tataw.

04:15.500 --> 04:16.940
Nagdinamag ni Jesus

04:16.940 --> 04:17.940
iti entero

04:17.940 --> 04:18.920
adaga ti siriya.

04:19.500 --> 04:20.840
Impan dagiti tataw

04:20.840 --> 04:21.480
kin kuwana

04:21.480 --> 04:22.380
dagiti adaan

04:22.380 --> 04:23.400
tinaduma-duma

04:23.400 --> 04:24.300
asaksakit

04:24.300 --> 04:25.300
kin ananayay.

04:25.520 --> 04:27.220
Dagiti linuganan

04:27.220 --> 04:28.200
dagiti demonyo,

04:28.200 --> 04:29.900
dagiti akis-kisil,

04:29.900 --> 04:32.020
kin dagiti paralitiko,

04:32.020 --> 04:33.700
pinayambag amin

04:33.700 --> 04:34.540
ida ni Jesus.

04:34.540 --> 04:36.420
Si Muro't kin kuwana

04:36.420 --> 04:37.960
dagiti aduo at tataw

04:37.960 --> 04:39.860
anagapo iji Galilea,

04:39.860 --> 04:41.260
di Kapulis,

04:41.260 --> 04:42.580
Hiruzalem,

04:42.580 --> 04:43.860
hudya,

04:43.860 --> 04:45.400
kin dagiti dagdaga

04:45.400 --> 04:46.320
iti balasyo

04:46.320 --> 04:47.020
ti Hurdan.

